# ==============================================================================
# NAME: Global Independent AGI & AI Ecosystem Complete Rule-Set (AGI.list)
# DESCRIPTION: Exhaustive coverage of global independent AGI labs, GPU Inference
#              Clouds, AI Search, Multi-Model Hubs, Agentic IDEs, Workflow/RAG,
#              Vector DBs, Generative Image/Video/3D/Audio Studios & AI SaaS.
#              Covers main sites, API endpoints, media delivery CDNs & processes.
#              Strictly excludes China Mainland AI (in China.list) and dedicated
#              brand lists (Google, OpenAI, Anthropic, Meta, Microsoft, Amazon,
#              X/xAI/Cursor & HuggingFace).
# UPDATED: 2026-10
# USAGE IN SURGE (Surge.conf):
#   RULE-SET,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zezetata/Proxyer/master/AGI.list,"💥 AGI",extended-matching
# ==============================================================================

